                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "i am wondering if it makes more sense to split up this 670 line checklist into things like\n\n```\n- checklist-fixes.md\n- checklist-changelog.md\n- checklist-abi.md\n- influences.md\n```\n\nand put that into a folder like `CONTRIBUTING/`\nwhich would enable folks to skip over things not relevant for their contribution \n\n(e.g. when they are not making a fix, they can skip the docs for creating fixes)"
                },
